{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122361","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122361/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122361/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122361/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122361","id":5137275902,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7-XzM4","number":122361,"title":"🤖 Fix crash calling `XRVRS.make_vrs_texture()` without a RenderingDevice","user":{"login":"manuaudio","id":188948351,"node_id":"U_kgDOC0Mffw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188948351?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuaudio","html_url":"https://github.com/manuaudio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuaudio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuaudio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuaudio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuaudio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuaudio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuaudio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuaudio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuaudio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuaudio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","color":"E94A26","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-13T02:51:03Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T09:16:25Z","closed_at":"2026-08-13T02:57:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122361","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122361","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122361.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122361.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"> [!INFO] *AI disclosure*: This contribution was authored by on an autonomous AI agent, on behalf of a user to fix the reported crash.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n`XRVRS::make_vrs_texture()` is bound to scripting, but dereferenced `RD::get_singleton()` without checking it:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/servers/xr/xr_vrs.cpp#L109\r\n\r\nRendering methods that are not backed by a `RenderingDevice` (Compatibility, headless) leave that singleton null, so calling the method from a script segfaulted the engine rather than failing gracefully. This matches the backtrace in the issue, where the crash surfaces inside `RenderingDevice::vrs_get_texel_size()` because `this` is null.\r\n\r\nThe guard mirrors what the destructor in the same file already does for `RS::get_singleton()`, and returns an invalid `RID` consistently with the two existing `ERR_FAIL_COND_V` early-outs in the method.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n\r\nAdded `tests/servers/test_xr_vrs.cpp`. The unit test suite runs headless with no `RenderingDevice`, so it exercises exactly the crashing path.\r\n\r\nVerified both ways on macOS (arm64, `vulkan=no metal=no opengl3=no`, so `RD::get_singleton()` is null):\r\n\r\n- Without the guard: `FATAL ERROR: test case CRASHED: SIGSEGV - Segmentation violation signal`\r\n- With the guard: `test cases: 2 | 2 passed | 0 failed`\r\n\r\nFull suite after the change: `1420 passed | 0 failed`, `421419 assertions`. `clang-format` clean.\r\n\r\nI do not have XR hardware, so this is verified through the scripting-facing path rather than an actual VR session.","closed_by":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122361/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122361/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}